[00:00.00] 作词 : Ella Langley/Joybeth Taylor/Trannie Anderson/Will Bundy
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Ella Langley/Joybeth Taylor/Trannie Anderson/Will Bundy
[00:15.20]If I'd stayed back home
[00:15.20]若我当初留在家乡
[00:19.09]Never spread my wings
[00:19.09]不曾展翅翱翔
[00:22.52]Let you build that house
[00:22.52]任你筑起那座房
[00:26.28]Let you buy that ring
[00:26.28]任你买下那枚戒指闪亮
[00:29.75]If I'd put down my dreams to put you first
[00:29.75]若我放弃梦想将你置于首位
[00:35.32]I could've been her
[00:35.32]我本可成为她
[00:38.51]If I'd dyed my hair
[00:38.51]若我染了头发
[00:42.02]If I'd lost that weight
[00:42.02]若我减掉体重
