[00:58.04]我本可成为她
[01:02.01]If I'd shut my mouth, faked that smile
[01:02.01]若我缄默不言 强颜欢笑
[01:06.35]Probably could've made it work for a while
[01:06.35]或许能勉强维系一段时光
