[01:13.28]There wouldn't be red wine stains on the ceiling
[01:13.28]天花板上便不会红酒斑驳
[01:17.07]If I'd buried my feelings
[01:17.07]若我埋葬所有感受
[01:19.79]Pushed down the hurt and let you cheat
[01:19.79]忍下伤痛任你欺瞒
[01:22.64]I could've been her
[01:22.64]我本可成为她
[01:25.88]But that wouldn't be me
[01:25.88]但那绝非真实的我
